{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/issues/2380","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/issues/2380/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/issues/2380/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/issues/2380/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/issues/2380","id":193065943,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxOTMwNjU5NDM=","number":2380,"title":"Data Providers cannot be generators anymore","user":{"login":"thanosp","id":1217690,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTc2OTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1217690?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanosp","html_url":"https://github.com/thanosp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanosp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanosp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanosp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanosp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanosp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanosp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanosp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanosp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thanosp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":44001,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NDAwMQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/labels/type/bug","name":"type/bug","color":"cc0000","default":false,"description":"Something is broken"},{"id":387514177,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzODc1MTQxNzc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/labels/type/backward-compatibility","name":"type/backward-compatibility","color":"cc0000","default":false,"description":"Something will be/is intentionally broken"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2016-12-02T09:03:57Z","updated_at":"2016-12-02T12:05:10Z","closed_at":"2016-12-02T12:05:10Z","author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I've just updated my project to 5.7 and immediately a certain category of tests broke.\r\nAll of them were using yield in data providers. \r\nMaybe it was never officially supported but it was handy especially for constructing \"bad input\" out of a single source of \"good input\".\r\nI only see the feature to 'Add support for multiple data providers' (#2223) as possibly related in the changelog.\r\n\r\nMy sample test case:\r\n```\r\n<?php\r\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\r\n\r\nuse PHPUnit\\Framework\\TestCase;\r\n\r\nclass GeneratorTest extends TestCase\r\n{\r\n    /**\r\n     * @dataProvider generatorData\r\n     * @param $data\r\n     */\r\n    public function testGeneratorProvider($data)\r\n    {\r\n        $this->assertNotEmpty($data);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /**\r\n     * @return Generator\r\n     */\r\n    public function generatorData(): Generator\r\n    {\r\n        yield 'testing';\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"sebastianbergmann","id":25218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastianbergmann","html_url":"https://github.com/sebastianbergmann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastianbergmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastianbergmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastianbergmann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastianbergmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastianbergmann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastianbergmann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastianbergmann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastianbergmann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastianbergmann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/issues/2380/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/issues/2380/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}